/-! # Erdos1041: theorems derived from what the paper results' proofs use

Each command below rebuilds, as a library theorem the kernel checks, a finding of
the argument graph about a theorem the papers cite. See
`ErdosProblems.ArgumentGraph.Derive` for what each command adds. -/

